  "hero_summary_zh": "米拉娜在战场的远处将致命的箭矢瞄准敌人，而她时刻准备着跃入战场。盟友可以在她的祝福下不被敌人探查，保证己方永远都在潜行。",
  "hero_summary_en": "As she takes aim from a distance with her deadly arrow, Mirana must always be ready to leap into battle. Able to shield her allies from the eyes of her enemies, she ensures that her team is always on the prowl.",
